      },
      "finding": null,
      "explanation": "The skill provides numerous examples of file creation and modification operations (merge, split, create new PDFs, encrypt, watermark) without any warnings or confirmation prompts to the user. A user could unknowingly overwrite important files, create large output files, or encrypt documents if these operations are executed without explicit user consent.",
      "remediation": "Add mandatory user warning/confirmation steps before file write operations: (1) Display the target file path and operation type, (2) Warn if file would be overwritten, (3) Request explicit user confirmation before proceeding. Include examples in the guide showing confirmation patterns like 'confirm_action=user_approval_required' or similar gating mechanisms.",
      "code_snippet": null,
      "intent": null,
      "tags": []
