      "remediation": "Add user confirmation before writing files. Implement a check that lists what files will be created and asks for explicit confirmation. Alternatively, add a --force or --no-confirm flag for programmatic use while defaulting to interactive confirmation. Example: Ask 'This will write up to N images to [path]. Continue? (y/n)' before proceeding with file operations.",
